From 79dccede8623127dbbe4ba04545321b03e301108 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nick Pray <nickwpray@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 15:29:09 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] fork: add dev-only design frame

Render real app components and the real theme through react-native-web for
design reviews, with no daemon and nothing in production builds.

- /design and /design/[name] routes, only on disk for Metro when
  EXPO_PUBLIC_PASEO_DESIGN_FRAME=1; the root layout renders them through a
  bare provider tree so host bootstrap, chrome and startup restore never run.
- Review bar: state, device (phone/tablet/desktop/all as real-width
  iframes), zoom, every built-in theme via the app's applyTheme path
  (postMessage to each iframe), and Check.
- Design registry, starter and flow templates, a token-driven catalog and
  a volume-meter design.
- design:check rules + CLI, also served to the frame by Metro middleware.
- npm run design / npm run design:check, docs/design-frame.md.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
