+# <Design name>
+
+Copy next to the design as `src/design/designs/<name>.md`. Keep it short; it is the
+brief a reviewer reads before clicking through the states.
+
+## Problem
+
+What the user is trying to do, and what gets in the way today.
+
+## States
+
+One line per state in the design file, in the same order.
+
+| State id | When the user sees it | What they can do |
+| -------- | --------------------- | ---------------- |
+| `empty`  |                       |                  |
+| `filled` |                       |                  |
+
+## Flow
+
+1. Entry point: where the user comes from.
+2. Each step, naming the state it lands on.
+3. Exit: where they end up.
+
+## Components
+
+Which shared components from `components/ui` carry this, and any primitive that
+is missing (propose it here rather than hand-rolling it in the design).
+
+## Open questions
+
+-
